{"id": "EUVD-2026-81285", "enisaUuid": "5d654731-e29f-3f19-98dd-e6d3c336f634", "description": "AVideo through 29.0 (commit c3edcc274c389816d434acadac07ee78eaf330c1) fails to validate video access permissions in the API like endpoint, allowing logged-in users to vote on password-protected and group-restricted videos. Attackers can submit like and dislike requests to increment vote counters on videos they cannot watch by calling the set.json.php endpoint with APIName parameters.", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T21:46:52", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-19T02:03:35", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/WWBN/AVideo/security/advisories/GHSA-rrcx-6vw7-xwj8", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/avideo-through-29.0-missing-authorization-check-via-api-like-endpoint"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-92585", "GHSA-hgf3-hf6h-jm9r"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.26, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0d6a6acc-9283-32d4-aa5e-17c43f4d4d76", "product": {"name": "AVideo", "vendor": {"name": "WWBN"}}, "product_version": "0 \u2264c3edcc274c389816d434acadac07ee78eaf330c1"}, {"id": "3483260f-a874-39c4-bba5-af127580a904", "product": {"name": "AVideo", "vendor": {"name": "WWBN"}}, "product_version": "0 \u226429.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b19eba2f-d2f3-3e9a-9dd0-c3a5b58a6446", "vendor": {"name": "WWBN"}}], "isExploited": false}